# Canonical Sandhi example — verification-repair semantics
#
# Sandhi marks a compatible adjacent pair. Store is a privileged operation in
# canonical PSL, so the pair is explicitly inside Adhikara and both members are
# Ring 0 Stores to the same Asiddha target.
#
# Expected ABI words:
#   0x200530F0  Write Vak (standalone Ring 2)
#   0x00AA00F0  Adhikara OPEN
#   0x00CC60E0  Store Yantra (SANDHI-FIRST)
#   0x00CC60F0  Store Yantra (pair second)
#   0x00BB00F0  Adhikara CLOSE
#
# This file establishes compiler-level pair formation only. Hardware/runtime
# atomicity remains an explicit open refinement obligation.

सञ्ज्ञा यन्त्र = 0x60 ।

तन्त्रशास्त्रम् {
    वाचम् लिखति ।

    अधिकारः {
        यन्त्र स्थापयति ।
        सन्धिः ।
        यन्त्र स्थापयति ।
    }
}
